Backport of JDK-8354941: Build failure with glibc 2.42 due to uabs() name collision.
Rename HotSpot uabs to g_uabs so it does not clash with C2Y uabs in stdlib.h.
Source: https://github.com/openjdk/jdk21u/commit/3445b99bedfba659da49d72a39979703969cfc91
Adapted to jdk22u 8153097cea2076988d8ad355d35ff08b04a89875.

